Pope Leo XIV on Sunday urged the Catholic Church to admit its own failings and heal “deep wounds” during an open-air Mass held in the pilgrimage town of Lourdes as part of his four-day trip to France. He is expected to meet privately in the afternoon with victims of clergy sexual abuse. Follow our liveblog for the latest developments.
